Suppose EMPSUPERFK is changed to ON DELETE CASCADE (ignore the other FKs). On the COMPANY state, if
DELETE FROM EMPLOYEE WHERE Lname = 'Borg';
is executed, which EMPLOYEE tuples are deleted, and in what order?

